  "sections": [
    "<main class=\"site-main home-page\" id=\"primary\">\n<section class=\"home-hero\" id=\"home\" style='background-image: var(--gradient-overlay-hero), url(\"/assets/f45d2f942a-verity_hero_2.webp\");'>\n<div class=\"container home-hero__inner\">\n<div class=\"home-hero__content animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<h1 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">Custom Homes &amp;<br/>\nLand Development</h1>\n<div class=\"home-hero__desc animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"2\">\n<p>Custom homes and land development throughout greater Charlotte and Lake Norman.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"3\">\n<a class=\"vbg-btn vbg-btn--arrow\" href=\"#contact\" target=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStart Your Project\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"interface-icon\">→</span></span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"home-services\" id=\"services\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-heading animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<h2 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">Our Services</h2>\n<div class=\"after\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-grid animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<article class=\"service-card animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"1\">\n<div class=\"service-card__image\">\n<a aria-label=\"Explore Land Development\" class=\"service-card__image-link\" href=\"/land-development-charlotte-nc/\">\n<img alt=\"Land development planning for a Charlotte-area homesite\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1000\" src=\"/assets/61d87d5380-verity_land-development.webp\" width=\"1000\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card__body\">\n<h3><a href=\"/land-development-charlotte-nc/\">Land Development</a></h3>\n<a class=\"service-card__description\" href=\"/land-development-charlotte-nc/\">\n<p>We purchase and develop large-scale land opportunities throughout the greater Charlotte region. Our team evaluates location, access, utilities, zoning, and long-term value to create residential projects with lasting potential.</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"cta-link js-verity-project-modal\" data-service=\"Land Development\" href=\"#verity-project-modal\">Start Your Project <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"interface-icon\">→</span></span></a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"service-card animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"2\">\n<div class=\"service-card__image\">\n<a aria-label=\"Explore New Home Construction\" class=\"service-card__image-link\" href=\"/custom-home-builder-charlotte-nc/\">\n<img alt=\"Custom luxury home construction in Charlotte and Lake Norman\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1000\" src=\"/assets/205cb24db5-verity_new-home.webp\" width=\"1000\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card__body\">\n<h3><a href=\"/custom-home-builder-charlotte-nc/\">New Home Construction</a></h3>\n<a class=\"service-card__description\" href=\"/custom-home-builder-charlotte-nc/\">\n<p>We build custom homes with thoughtful design, quality materials, and craftsmanship that stands the test of time. From private residences to luxury homes near Lake Norman, each project is planned with purpose and built with care.</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"cta-link js-verity-project-modal\" data-service=\"New Home Construction\" href=\"#verity-project-modal\">Start Your Project <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"interface-icon\">→</span></span></a>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"team-section\" id=\"about\">\n<div class=\"container team-section__grid animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<div class=\"team-section__image animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">\n<img alt=\"image-5fgkopr\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/assets/744415db06-image-5fgkopr.webp\" width=\"1024\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-section__content animated\" data-id=\"2\">\n<div class=\"section-heading animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<h2 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">Leading Your Team</h2>\n<div class=\"after\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<div class=\"delay-250 animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"2\"><p>At Verity Building Group, leadership means guiding every phase of the project with clarity, integrity, and experienced construction oversight. From land acquisition and planning to custom residential construction, VBG brings the right people, process, and vision together to build with purpose.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-values animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<div class=\"team-value animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"1\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"team-value__icon\">\n<img alt=\"block-icon-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/30b94a26a8-block-icon-2.webp\" width=\"512\"/>\n</span>\n<h3>Clear Communication</h3>\n<p>You’ll always know where your project stands, from early planning through final completion.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-value animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"team-value__icon\">\n<img alt=\"icon-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/d50be670c9-icon-2.webp\" width=\"512\"/>\n</span>\n<h3>Skill &amp; Expertise</h3>\n<p>Built with attention to detail and a commitment to lasting value.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-value animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"3\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"team-value__icon\">\n<img alt=\"icon-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/42736f4af4-icon-3.webp\" width=\"512\"/>\n</span>\n<h3>Trusted Partnership</h3>\n<p>We treat every project as a collaboration, not just a contract.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"work-section\" id=\"gallery\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"work-section__header\">\n<div class=\"section-heading section-heading--inline animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<h2 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">Our Work</h2>\n<p class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"2\">A glimpse of recent residential and land development projects.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"work-gallery animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<div class=\"work-gallery__items work-gallery-init animated fadeIn\" data-id=\"1\">\n<div class=\"swiper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img alt=\"gallery-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"486\" src=\"/assets/018219e5b4-gallery-1.webp\" width=\"487\"/></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img alt=\"gallery-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"486\" src=\"/assets/206eb54091-gallery-2.webp\" width=\"487\"/></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img alt=\"gallery-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"486\" src=\"/assets/d422901874-gallery-3.webp\" width=\"487\"/></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img alt=\"gallery-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"486\" src=\"/assets/0e9eb6aeba-gallery-4.webp\" width=\"487\"/></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img alt=\"gallery-5\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"486\" src=\"/assets/a4b53212c6-gallery-5.webp\" width=\"487\"/></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img alt=\"image-4dldflpf\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"864\" src=\"/assets/37e2828046-image-4dldflpf.webp\" width=\"1184\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-button-next\"></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-button-prev\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"contact-section\" id=\"contact\" style='background-image: var(--gradient-overlay-warm), url(\"/assets/3b5da70afa-conatct_image.webp\");'>\n<div class=\"container contact-section__grid\">\n<div class=\"contact-section__content\">\n<div class=\"section-heading section-heading--light animatedParent animateOnce\">\n<h2 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\">Let’s Build Something Together</h2>\n<div class=\"after\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"animatedParent animateOnce\">\n<div class=\"delay-250 animated fadeInLeftShort\">\n<p>Ready to develop land or build a custom home? Contact Verity Building Group to start a conversation about your next opportunity in greater Charlotte, Lake Norman, and surrounding areas.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n<div class=\"contact-actions\">\n<a class=\"contact-action delay-500 animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"1\" href=\"tel:1234567890\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"interface-icon\">✓</span>\n<span>123.456.7890</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"contact-action delay-500 animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"2\" href=\"mailto:info@veritybuildinggroup.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"interface-icon\">✉</span>\n<span>EMAIL VERITY</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contact-card\">\n<div class=\"section-heading animatedParent animateOnce\">\n<h2 class=\"animated fadeInRightShort\">Contact Us</h2>\n<div class=\"after\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"animatedParent animateOnce\">\n<div class=\"delay-250 animated fadeInRightShort\">\n</div></div></div></div></section></main>",
